| 蒸馏候选 | Distillation Candidate | `casey distill` 产的非权威候选物（候选 TestCase + 候选 mapping + manifest）；降权标记落 manifest（`artifactKind:'distill-candidate'`）+ 文件名 + 负向不变量，绝不 `signed`/`replayReady`，须重走全链 + 人签才算数 | — |
